                                        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pills-5" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="Director&#39;sMessage"  ><p>Dear Learners, Educators and School Leaders,<br/><br/>
Welcome to the School of Education at IGNOU!<br/><br/>
It is with great pride and enthusiasm that I welcome you to a community that is dedicated shaping learning through building capacity of teachers across all levels of education. Whether you are beginning your journey as a future educator or deepening your expertise, you are stepping into a promising open and distance learning (ODL) institution – one that carriers the power to transform lives and uplift learning communities from the foundational stage to higher education.<br/><br/>
We are a pioneering ODL institution at the national and international level with 16 popular programmes in which you can enrol as per your interest and eligibility. The School also has a doctoral research degree (Ph. D.) programme offered in regular mode.<br/><br/>
Our faculty is committed to academic excellence, reflective practice and the preparation as well as capacity building by educators who are not only skilled and knowledgeable but also compassionate and responsive to the needs of diverse learners. Here, you will be challenged to think critically, act ethically, and grow both professionally and personally.<br/><br/>
We believe in learning that is active, inclusive, and grounded in real-world practices. Most of our programmes combine rigorous internship, project work with meaningful field experiences, mentorship and innovation in teaching and learning. As a learner of our School, in any of our learner support centre (study centre) you shall also be given exposure to lead, inspire and make a lasting impact in the field you chose to work in.<br/><br/>
We are excited to support you in this journey and look forward to your boarding any of our programmes.<br/><br/>
With warm regards,<br/><br/>
Prof. Amitav Mishra<br/>
Director, School of Education<br/>
Indira Gandhi National Open University<br/>
New Delhi</p></div>
