Her areas of interest and expertise include Environmental Education, Science Education, Mathematics Education, Educational Statistics, Guidance & Counselling, and Teacher Education. She has shared her knowledge and insights through more than 110 invited talks at seminars, UGC-Human Resource Development Centres (HRDCs), and teacher training programs. She has developed over 22 video lectures for SWAYAM and contributed video lectures to the Swayam Prabha channel. Her contributions also include developing units for self-learning materials for various IGNOU programs.
